  _description: "Parque tecnol\xF3gico com incentivo fiscal atrai empresas de exporta\xE7\xE3o
    de tecnologia. Modelo real: o Porto Digital de Recife, refer\xEAncia brasileira
    de polo de inova\xE7\xE3o \u2014 gera renda e pesquisa, mas o entorno valoriza
    r\xE1pido e pressiona quem j\xE1 morava ali."
  _cardNameEn: Export Technology Park
  _descriptionEn: "A tech park with tax incentives attracts technology export companies.
    Real model: Porto Digital in Recife, a Brazilian reference for an innovation
    hub \u2014 generates income and research, but the surrounding area appreciates
    fast and pressures those who already lived there."
